{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-mindaku-portal",
    "name": "Mind Aku Portal (new-clients-final)",
    "description": "API yang dipakai `new-clients-final`:\n\n1. **Shop** — beli starter → create API key di bawah Root User\n2. **Portal** — status, models, logs, top-up USD (auth Bearer API key)\n\nAlur lokal (PAYMENT_MOCK=true):\n1. Shop → Config\n2. Shop → Checkout\n3. Shop → Simulate order\n4. Shop → Claim → simpan `apiKey` ke environment\n5. Portal → Status / Logs / Top up",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "claimSecret",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "paymentId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "logId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "buyerName",
      "value": "Postman Test Buyer"
    },
    {
      "key": "usdAmount",
      "value": "10"
    },
    {
      "key": "refCode",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "portalAdminKey",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "withdrawalId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Shop — Create API Key (Root User)",
      "description": "Public endpoints. Setelah bayar (atau simulate mock), claim sekali untuk dapat API key. Key di-create di bawah Root User.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Shop Config",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shop/config",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "shop", "config"]
            },
            "description": "Harga starter (IDR), kredit USD, rate FX, daftar model, flag mock/turnstile."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Shop Checkout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.orderId) pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', body.orderId);",
                  "  if (body.claimSecret) pm.collectionVariables.set('claimSecret', body.claimSecret);",
                  "  console.log('Saved orderId + claimSecret. mock=', body.mock);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{buyerName}}\",\n  \"successReturnUrl\": \"{{baseUrl}}/payments/success\",\n  \"cancelReturnUrl\": \"{{baseUrl}}/payments/cancel\",\n  \"paymentMethodTypeCode\": \"QRIS\",\n  \"refCode\": \"{{refCode}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shop/checkout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "shop", "checkout"]
            },
            "description": "Buat order guest purchase. Optional `refCode` untuk referral. Response menyimpan `orderId` + `claimSecret` ke collection variables.\n\nJika Turnstile aktif, tambahkan field `turnstileToken`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Shop Simulate (mock only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"claimSecret\": \"{{claimSecret}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shop/orders/{{orderId}}/simulate",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "shop", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "simulate"]
            },
            "description": "Hanya jalan jika `PAYMENT_MOCK=true`. Menyelesaikan pembayaran & provision API key di bawah Root User."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Shop Claim API Key",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.apiKey) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('apiKey', body.apiKey);",
                  "    console.log('API key claimed and saved to collection variable apiKey');",
                  "  }",
                  "} else if (pm.response.code === 202) {",
                  "  console.log('Still pending — wait for webhook/simulate then claim again');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"{{orderId}}\",\n  \"claimSecret\": \"{{claimSecret}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shop/claim",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "shop", "claim"]
            },
            "description": "Ambil API key **sekali**. Status:\n- `200` ready → `apiKey` tersimpan ke variable\n- `202` pending (belum paid)\n- `409` sudah di-claim"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Portal — Auth by API Key",
      "description": "Semua request di folder ini butuh `Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Status (login check)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Validasi API key + usage summary (sama seperti login di portal)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Models",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/models",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "models"]
            },
            "description": "Daftar model yang boleh dipakai key ini."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Logs",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.data && body.data.length > 0 && body.data[0].id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('logId', body.data[0].id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/logs?limit=20&offset=0",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "logs"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20"
                },
                {
                  "key": "offset",
                  "value": "0"
                },
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "ok",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "model",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Log request untuk API key yang dipakai auth. Query opsional: `status` (ok|error), `model`, `search`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Log Detail",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/logs/{{logId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "logs", "{{logId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Detail satu log. `logId` diisi otomatis dari GET Logs."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Portal — Top up USD",
      "description": "Top-up kredit USD ke API key yang sedang dipakai (owner key = Root User).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Payments Config",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/payments/config",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "payments", "config"]
            },
            "description": "Rate IDR/USD, paket top-up, saldo payg, flag mock."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Payments History",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/payments",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "payments"]
            },
            "description": "Riwayat top-up untuk API key ini."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Create Top-up Payment",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('paymentId', body.id);",
                  "  else if (body.orderId) pm.collectionVariables.set('paymentId', body.orderId);",
                  "  console.log('paymentId=', pm.collectionVariables.get('paymentId'), 'mock=', body.mock);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"usdAmount\": {{usdAmount}},\n  \"successReturnUrl\": \"http://localhost:5173/payments/success\",\n  \"cancelReturnUrl\": \"http://localhost:5173/payments/cancel\",\n  \"paymentMethodTypeCode\": \"QRIS\",\n  \"refCode\": \"{{refCode}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/payments",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "payments"]
            },
            "description": "Buat pembayaran top-up USD. Optional `refCode` jika key belum punya sticky referrer. Backend konversi ke IDR via SumoPod.\n\nUbah `usdAmount` di collection variables."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Simulate Top-up (mock only)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/payments/{{paymentId}}/simulate",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "payments", "{{paymentId}}", "simulate"]
            },
            "description": "Hanya jika `PAYMENT_MOCK=true`. Kredit USD ke RemainQuota API key."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. AI Relay (opsional)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Chat Completions",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    { \"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello from Postman\" }\n  ],\n  \"stream\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "chat", "completions"]
            },
            "description": "Relay OpenAI-compatible. Setelah sukses, cek ulang GET Logs."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Affiliate",
      "description": "Program referral per API key. Komisi 10% ke AffBalance. Bonus pembeli +10% RemainQuota hanya di guest shop (GKP); top-up (TKP) hanya komisi affiliate.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Affiliate Summary",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{apiKey}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/affiliate",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "affiliate"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Enable Affiliate",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.affCode) pm.collectionVariables.set('refCode', body.affCode);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{apiKey}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/affiliate/enable",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "affiliate", "enable"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Affiliate Ledger",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{apiKey}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/affiliate/ledger",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "affiliate", "ledger"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET My Withdrawals",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{apiKey}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/affiliate/withdrawals",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "affiliate", "withdrawals"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Request Withdrawal",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('withdrawalId', String(body.id));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{apiKey}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"usdAmount\": 10,\n  \"bankName\": \"BCA\",\n  \"bankAccount\": \"1234567890\",\n  \"accountName\": \"Test Affiliate\",\n  \"note\": \"Postman withdraw\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/affiliate/withdrawals",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "affiliate", "withdrawals"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Admin — Affiliate Withdrawals",
      "description": "Header X-Portal-Admin-Key = PORTAL_ADMIN_KEY. Tanpa key → 404.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Admin Stats",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Portal-Admin-Key", "value": "{{portalAdminKey}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/affiliate/stats",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "affiliate", "stats"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Admin Withdrawals",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Portal-Admin-Key", "value": "{{portalAdminKey}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/affiliate/withdrawals?status=requested",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "affiliate", "withdrawals"],
              "query": [{ "key": "status", "value": "requested" }]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH Mark Withdrawal Paid",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Portal-Admin-Key", "value": "{{portalAdminKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"paid\",\n  \"adminNote\": \"Transferred via BCA\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/affiliate/withdrawals/{{withdrawalId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "affiliate", "withdrawals", "{{withdrawalId}}"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
